Package: PathMI
Type: Package
Title: Mutual Information Estimators for Histopathology Embeddings
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sagnik", "Bhadury", email = "bhadury@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates mutual information between patient-level histopathology
    tile embeddings and binary molecular targets (e.g. MSI status, gene fusion
    status), using three interchangeable classifiers: an unpenalized OLS/DOE
    estimator for the low-dimensional regime, a LASSO-CV logistic estimator
    for the high-dimensional regime, and a fully Bayesian Polya-Gamma
    logistic horseshoe estimator (SUBHO) with a marginal-likelihood feature
    walk. Each estimator ships with a permutation test and
    Benjamini-Hochberg FDR correction across molecular targets.
